      "created_at": "2013-02-07T00:03:15.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The teaser site for GSF mentions that the game uses \"panels\".&nbsp; I assume that means actual panels of cardboard to block people from seeing your cards or whatever (right?), perhaps used when a card play needs to be revealed simultaneously.&nbsp; But in a co-op game, what would you need to hide from your co-space pirates?&nbsp; Why wouldn't you just talk out what the best order of play is rather than doing it hidden?</p><p>So maybe I've got it wrong.&nbsp; Does anyone know or care to speculate what the panels are and what they're for?</p>",
